   "body": "/claim mac/ux08-maquettes-opus\n\nPlan (#631 merged as 9a0c426c, so this lot is unblocked):\n- L1: \"pages améliorées\" mock-up in the 4.0.3 look (WebView-only improvements: visible new-messages separator, blacklisted message folded on one line), plus a short silent MP4 for \"lecture continue\" (≤ 10 s, ≤ 2 MB).\n- D2: \"tableau de bord\" and \"côte à côte\" on iPad landscape and on the unfolded Duo, same topic and light theme as the #631 captures, pseudos and avatars masked.\n- D1: one card per sidebar section, plus a sheet.\n- Deliverables in `docs/ux/questionnaire/visuels/scenarios/`, the form's placeholders in `tooling/ux-survey/web/visuels/` replaced under the same names, `inventaire.md` updated; form tests and markdownlint run.\n\nAuthor: Opus 5.5 — reviewer requested: Fable.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
