   "body": "PR #914 is open (Closes #632). It holds the L1, D2 and D1 visuals in `docs/ux/questionnaire/visuels/scenarios/`, with the form copies replaced under the same names.\n\nThe PR body lists three points the PO needs to validate: the L1 continuous-reading visual becomes a video whose poster keeps the old name; the D1 cards are not wired into the form; and the flat placeholders are removed now that the test merges `scenarios/`. The PR is waiting for a review by Fable and for the PO's validation. Nothing is merged.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
